      "about": "A conductor cancels the Work a newer request no longer wants and answers that request. Once the stop is confirmed, the older delegation's answer is the cancelled line, then completed (DEL:478): a cancel has no handover's shape, so the reader needs no rule to tell them apart and says the line like any result.",
